// The kit's texts in both languages, one module (one request when a page loads). Every key must exist in both
// (test/frontend/i18n.test.mjs). An app's own texts (setupKit({ locales })) are laid over these: an app key of the
// same name wins. {app} and {appShort} are the app's name ("Mytko Finance", "Finance"); other {name} placeholders are
// filled by t(). Plural values are objects keyed by Intl.PluralRules categories.
// (locales/uk.js and pl.js still give each language alone, for tools and older imports.)

